the inventory page's words, src/game/page_words.cpp). Adds TextureCache::addDynamicReplacement (a picture handed over
at run time for one texture hash, winning over the packs'), State::dynamicReplacementProvider (asked for each new
texture hash with the hash and the RDRAM address its data came from) and SharedQueueResources::framebufferCaptures
(part of a framebuffer's high resolution picture copied before the next workload draws); and a gap filler
(shaders/GapFillCS.hlsl, RenderTarget::fillGaps, run after each framebuffer pass that wrote depth) for the hairline cracks
between separately drawn meshes.

